      "title": "[Boing Boing] Too much \"human poo\" in the Brecon Beacons",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/052c4a10-a7d4-11f1-809e-25fc74c1ec7d.jpg.webp?fit=1536%2C863&amp;quality=55&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/052c4a10-a7d4-11f1-809e-25fc74c1ec7d.jpg.webp?fit=1536%2C863&amp;quality=55&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/09/04/too-much-human-poo-in-the-brecon-beacons.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Too much &quot;human poo&quot; in the Brecon Beacons\"><img alt=\"Photo: Bannau Brycheiniog National Park Authority\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"863\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/052c4a10-a7d4-11f1-809e-25fc74c1ec7d.jpg.webp?fit=1536%2C863&amp;quality=55&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 5px;\" width=\"1536\" /></a><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\"<a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c62jg4d433mo\">Anger as human poo and maggot-infested food left behind at beauty spot</a>,\" goes the headline at BBC News. If it had been any other species&#8230;</p>\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">[The] National Park said there was \"no justification\" for fly-tipping after noticing a \"change in attitude\" among visitors to its beauty spots, leading to an increase in litter dumping.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p> &#8212; <a class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/09/04/too-much-human-poo-in-the-brecon-beacons.html\">Read the rest </a></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/09/04/too-much-human-poo-in-the-brecon-beacons.html\">Too much &quot;human poo&quot; in the Brecon Beacons</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://boingboing.net\">Boing Boing</a>.</p>",
