      "title": "[Boing Boing] Hikers let Gemini plan their Mount Shasta climb. Search and Rescue brought them home",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Death-e1788465776664.jpg?fit=768%2C512&amp;quality=60&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Death-e1788465776664.jpg?fit=768%2C512&amp;quality=60&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Death-e1788465776664.jpg?fit=768%2C512&amp;quality=60&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/09/03/gemini-ai-hikers-mount-shasta-rescue.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Hikers let Gemini plan their Mount Shasta climb. Search and Rescue brought them home\"><img alt=\"Studio Romantic/Shutterstock\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"512\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/boingboing.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Death-e1788465776664.jpg?fit=768%2C512&amp;quality=60&amp;ssl=1\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 5px;\" width=\"768\" /></a><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Trust AI to help fix your PC or make a funny image to tease your friends; don't use it to plan your ascent of a 14,000-foot volcano that regularly kills people.  </p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Three college students used Google Gemini to plan their ascent of Mount Shasta. &#8212; <a class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/09/03/gemini-ai-hikers-mount-shasta-rescue.html\">Read the rest </a></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/09/03/gemini-ai-hikers-mount-shasta-rescue.html\">Hikers let Gemini plan their Mount Shasta climb. Search and Rescue brought them home</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://boingboing.net\">Boing Boing</a>.</p>",
